# The WhatsApp assistant's agent, bundled at synth for AgentCore (lib/assistant-stack.ts).
.build

# macOS Finder writes one of these into every folder it opens, recording the
# window size and sort order for whoever opened it. Two people's copies never
# match, so committing it turns every commit into a possible merge conflict
# about nothing. Nothing here packages it — the Lambdas are bundled by esbuild
# from named entry files — so removing it changes no synthesised template.
.DS_Store
